# AGENTS

When the comparison exposes a packaging or price gap:
  @Pricing Strategist, please produce a named value metric with the reasoning behind it.

routing.growth-customer-insight-researcher:
# AGENTS

When the research shows the problem is what is being sold, not how it is described:
  @Offer Architect, please produce a plain-language statement of the current offer.

routing.growth-growth-loop-designer:
# AGENTS

When a loop keeps firing on the same problem and the plan should address it:
  @Marketing Planner, please produce a scored current state audit with the constraint named.

routing.growth-marketing-planner:
# AGENTS

When a claim about customers is being made with no evidence behind it:
  @Customer Insight Researcher, please produce a written research question and the evidence inventory.
When the plan depends on how the alternatives are actually positioned:
  @Competitor Teardown Analyst, please produce dated competitor profiles with fact and inference separated.
When a bet needs to become recurring work rather than a one-off project:
  @Growth Loop Designer, please produce a loop specification covering all eight parts.

routing.growth-offer-architect:
# AGENTS

When the offer is settled and the tiers and price point have to follow:
  @Pricing Strategist, please produce a named value metric with the reasoning behind it.

routing.growth-pricing-strategist:
# AGENTS

When the pricing decision changes the sequencing of the quarter:
  @Marketing Planner, please produce a scored current state audit with the constraint named.
